# Optional: use an HTTP client that supports .http files, or copy each request
# into your preferred client. Set your backend URL and chosen token here.
@backend = http://localhost:3000
@crm = http://localhost:4002
@token = superday-demo-token

### CRM: normal response, bypass random-looking failures
GET {{crm}}/crm/portfolios/P-9001?mode=ok

### CRM: set global mode to ok (change to error, timeout, or auto as needed)
POST {{crm}}/__control
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "ok" }

### CRM: inspect calls while testing your backend cache
GET {{crm}}/__stats

### Your backend: must reject missing auth
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001

### Your backend: mapped metadata
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your backend: holdings in USD
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001/holdings?currency=USD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your backend: current-year history
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001/performance-history?range=YTD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your backend: invalid range
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001/performance-history?range=invalid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your backend: allocation
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001/allocation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your backend: account list
GET {{backend}}/clients/abc123/portfolios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your backend: household totals
GET {{backend}}/clients/abc123/household-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your backend: missing optional detail fields
GET {{backend}}/holdings/NEW/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your backend: empty account
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-EMPTY/holdings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your backend: unknown account
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/UNKNOWN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
